## 2. Directory Architecture

```text
PlantbreedAIAgent/
│
├── assets/                     # UI branding (logo.svg)
│
├── frontend/                   # The "Face" (User Interface)
│   └── app.py                  # Streamlit application
│
├── api/                        # The "Spine" (Communication)
│   └── server.py               # FastAPI server exposing endpoints
│
├── agent_core/                 # The "Brain" (AI Logic)
